  "fullDescription": "Bring cozy farmhouse warmth, charming seasonal harvest aesthetics, and soft botanical elegance to your creative projects with this gorgeous Rustic Autumn Floral & Wreath Watercolor Collection! This hand-painted watercolor collection features 20 high-resolution PNG illustrations showcasing delightful autumn elements—including rustic fall wreaths, wheat stalks, vibrant seasonal flowers, autumn leaves, eucalyptus greenery, and a woven harvest basket.\n\nPerfect for autumn crafts, seasonal junk journals, scrapbooking, sublimation designs, print-on-demand products, stickers, and rustic home decor!\n\nWhat’s Included:\n\n20 Individual PNG Files with transparent backgrounds\n\nHigh Resolution: 300 DPI for crisp, high-definition printing\n\nClean cutouts suitable for layering on light, dark, or textured backdrops\n\nIdeal Use Cases:\n\nPrint-On-Demand (POD): Fall t-shirts, botanical tote bags, aprons, autumn coffee mugs, tumbler wraps, and throw pillows\n\nCrafting & DIY: Cricut/Silhouette print & cut projects, junk journals, scrapbooking, autumn stickers, and planner layouts\n\nStationery & Decor: Fall party invitations, greeting cards, gift tag stickers, wall art prints, and bookmark designs",
